        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mario Mazzacurati, Ettore Bugatti\n- Companies: Automobiles Ettore Bugatti\n- Places: South Africa, Molsheim, Alsace\n- Products: Bugatti cars\n- Events: 1936 South African Grand Prix\n\nFacts:\n- Automobiles Ettore Bugatti was founded in 1909 in the then German city of Molsheim, Alsace, by Italian-born Ettore Bugatti.\n- Mario Mazzacurati was an Italian engineer and auto racing driver who was active in South Africa.\n- Mario Mazzacurati won the 1936 South African Grand Prix driving Bugatti cars under the pseudonym Mario Massacuratti.\n- Automobiles Ettore Bugatti was a French manufacturer of high-performance automobiles.",
